    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olenchan kegh, “Nyonö atyamenin ngörekyö ailït ngörekyö lö tïrpïl.” Wölo kïlïkwï nyoni tïkwïl kwïle. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onkïtwan lö roröt kï chepoynön akï möminye kïgh nyo karam nyo iwu ngörekyö. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayaran or nyo ngöröko portanyu ompö dipay,* akïtökïmi mïkulöwunyan kuntöghoghwanïn ompö ngöghomnyö nko wölo kïnömtoy sölwontön, ntökïtenö asïwan lö kigh ne nyo mïchini ptangengmötin atökwigh ompö ngwïnyi mïröt ompö osiswekwa cho ngörï cho pö ngwïnyinï. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.10.23+1KI.10.24+1KI.10.25+1KI.10.26+1KI.10.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1Pöy 10:23-27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.9.22+2CH.9.23+2CH.9.24+2CH.9.25+2CH.9.26+2CH.9.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2Ot 9:22-27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Oghchan kegh ighisyewut cho echön, kyatekan korïn, akötkötyï kegh pareni sapipun ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyangoran pareni tapïkoy, aghchï kegh wölo kiwuro, akötkötyï wöloni keti akwa cho sisinchö. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyoghchan kegh ngörpil atocholchï pögh ketichoni kïpityö. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.4.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1Pöy 4:23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kyalan sekey cho chang, akimi sekeyi walaka cho kikïyichï konyan, kyotïngetan ngat kyak cho chang cho pö tïch nko kechir, ki chang kïtïl chi ki pö chi anka tïkwïl nyo kinya kïmang Yerusalem ato le tagh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.10.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1Pöy 10:10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.14.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "14:22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kyotïkumchan kegh ngat ropïyen nko koltin nko kaplawach nyo pö pöytoghin nko cho pö koroswe walaka cho kyapaytan. Ki tumwanïn mïrön nko kor atangarakan, kyopön chemïnïngwen* cho teno cho kyomökan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.29.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1Ot 29:25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kïlenyona kyochan wow kïtïl pich löwïr cho kinya kïmang Yerusalem, amelö kirörchanïn ngöghomnyenyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyonyorwan kïgh anka tïkwïl nyo kyomökan. Kimataghanye kegh kïgh nyo kyongörökyinan, kyokwolan kegh tïkwïn löwïr cho kyaghan akïlïkwï choni tïkwïl ropöweko sïngutköchan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atolapay anana nyu ighisyewut lapay cho kyaghan, olan aros, kïlïkwï kwïle choni löwïr akïlenye ato kïyonöy yomat, akï möminye tösunötö ngwïnyi asis.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenyona awaghakan ananan lö ne ngöghomnyö nko chepoynön nko sölwontön, ompöwölo möminye kïgh nyo muköy kwighöy nyo sis kïpoto nyo kökikwigh pöytoghinte anka nyo kimi tawunyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asïwan nyu lö kichö pïchigh ngöghomnyö kïtïl sölwontön, kïle wölo pïchigh löpoyïn kïtïl tuwïn. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sïwïyi pich cho ngöghomöch wölo töngöy, poto sölwöy cho mösïwïyicha, wölo kipköchanïn lö ityini chane kinyarata akong laras. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atolapay ononchan kegh lö, “Kïle ato ityini kïyoni sölwö, kwitwanïn tïkwïl, kï kölö ne nyu tongöghomitwan kïtïl?” Atolapay ononchan kegh lö kichö kwïlenyoni tïkwïl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Möminye chi nyo nonöy chi nyo ngöghom kokay akï möminye chi nyo nonöy sölwö, ompöwölo kïwutyegho chane löwïr kokay ompö osis cho pkonöy. Meghsot pich tïkwïl, cho ngöghomöch nko sölwöy! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïghöchanïn nyu söpon, ompöwölo kingwonchanïn kïgh nyo kigho ngwïnyi asis, ompöwölo kwïle choni löwïr akïlenye ato kïyonöy yomat.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïghöchanïn nyu ighisyenyu kïmïkul nyo kyasïngan ompö ngwïnyi asis, ompöwölo pïsyinan chitö anka kïmïl nyo mötïny, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akï ngo nyo nkït lö ekïlïku nyinte chi nyo ngöghom anta sölwö? Akwanyï pöyu nyinte tïkwïn löwïr cho kyasïngan apöghisyeghö ngöghomnyenyu ompö ngwïnyi asis. Kwïlenyoni tïkwïl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenyona ogheghchan kegh lö, kilö ne tonoghyan nyo teno nyoni ompö ngwïnyi asis, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ompöwölo mi ato mötïnye kïpïstö chi tïkuchi löwïr cho kisïnga ompö ngöghomnyö nko kinkïtöt nko chïreryö, kïmïl chi nyo kimöswanganye ewunyi akïngörökyï. Kwïlenyoni tïkwïl akïghöyityö nyo wow. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne nyo nyoruno chi ighisyenyi kïmïkul nko ompö kighotatenyi nyo sïngo ompö ngwïnyi asis? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOB.5.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ayu 5:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOB.14.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "14:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ompöwölo wongu ompö nyinte osiswechi löwïr ompö kichïr ompö otyogh. Memungönye nyinte kïrkegh otini mi kïrïwöy kwïlenyoni tïkwïl.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.2.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.2.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 2:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
